  No scripted how-to instruction is displayed in the Gym.
- The standard stall hint now reads (Trick Deck Right) `STALLED? HOP + W SAIL`
  or (Tricks Left) `STALLED? HOP + UP SAIL`, with a generic touch/gamepad
